          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CMkwDMcBDH9aKLAJZD1d-21" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="1640" height="1280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CMkwDMcBDH9aKLAJZD1d-22" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;loop()&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="640" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7khImdaLmiWVp4Yu-r4f-34" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="CMkwDMcBDH9aKLAJZD1d-25" target="7khImdaLmiWVp4Yu-r4f-5" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="CMkwDMcBDH9aKLAJZD1d-25" value="&lt;p style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;readIncomingMessages()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Checks for and reads incoming CAN messages.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;If there &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;are no errors, do the following &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;depending&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;on CAN ID:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;MOTOR_LOCKOUT_MSG_ID: Set &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;motorLock&lt;/font&gt; to the value of the first byte&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;NODE_STATUS_REQUEST_MSG_ID&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;: Send status message to CAN interface&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;THROTTLE_BRAKE_MSG_ID: Set &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;throttle&lt;/font&gt; and  &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;brakePos&lt;/font&gt; to the value of the first and &lt;br&gt;fourth byte respectively. Reset the throttle timed out flag.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;REV_BOOST_MSG_ID: Set &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;throttleRev&lt;/font&gt; to the value of the first byte.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;BATT_STATS_MSG_ID: Multiply the value of the fourth byte by 256. Set &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;battCurrent&lt;/font&gt; &lt;br&gt;to the sum of the product and the third byte of the message. Set &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;battTemp&lt;/font&gt; to the value of &lt;br&gt;the third byte of the message.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;STEERING_MSG_ID: Set &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;steeringAngle&lt;/font&gt; to the value of the first byte in the message&lt;br&gt;and reset the steering timed out flag&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;FL_SPEED_MSG_ID: Set the front left wheel speed to the sum of the value of the &lt;br&gt;first byte and 256 multiplied by the value of the second byte. Update the time that&lt;br&gt;last wheel speed message was received.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;FR_SPEED_MSG_ID: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Set the front right wheel speed to the sum of the value of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;first byte and 256 multiplied by the value of the second byte.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;RL_SPEED_MSG_ID: Set the rear left wheel speed to the sum of the value of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;first&lt;br&gt;byte and 256 multiplied by the value of the second byte.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;RR_SPEED_MSG_ID: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Set the rear right wheel speed to the sum of the value of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;first&lt;br&gt;byte and 256 multiplied by the value of the second byte.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;L_R_DIFF_MSG_ID: Set &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;lrPowerBalance&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;lrPowerScale&lt;/font&gt; to the first and second byte &lt;br&gt;of the message respectively. Update EEPROM on left-right power balance and power scale&lt;br&gt;using &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;EEPROM.update()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;F_R_DIFF_MSG_ID:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; Set &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;frPowerBalance&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;frPowerScale&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;to the first and second &lt;br&gt;byte of the message respectively. Update EEPROM on front-rear power balance and &lt;br&gt;power scale using &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;EEPROM.update()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fixedSize=1;fillColor=none;size=20;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="680" width="560" height="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
